          "_name": "article5",
          "_sourceTheme": "ascentm5",
          "_customHTML": "<section data-bs-version=\"5.1\" class=\"ascentm5 article5\" group=\"Article\">\n  <mbr-parameters>\n    <header>Size</header>\n    <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Full Width\" name=\"fullWidth\" checked>\n    <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Top\" name=\"paddingTop\" min=\"0\" max=\"10\" step=\"1\" value=\"5\">\n    <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Bottom\" name=\"paddingBottom\" min=\"0\" max=\"10\" step=\"1\" value=\"5\">\n    <header>Show/Hide</header>\n    <input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"showTitle\" title=\"Title\">\n    <input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"showSubtitle\" title=\"Subtitle\">\n    <header>Cards</header>\n    <input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"showCardTitle\" title=\"Title\" checked>\n    <input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"showLink\" title=\"Link\">\n    <input type=\"color\" name=\"cardsBg\" title=\"Card BG 1\" value=\"#ffffff\">\n    <input type=\"color\" name=\"cardsBg2\" title=\"Card BG 2\" value=\"#4f6df5\">\n    <input type=\"color\" name=\"iconColor\" title=\"Icon Color\" value=\"#ffffff\">\n    <input type=\"color\" name=\"iconBg\" title=\"Icon BG\" value=\"#000000\">\n\n    <header>Background</header>\n    <fieldset type=\"background\" name=\"bg\" required>\n      <input type=\"image\" title=\"Image\" value=\"../_images/background1.jpg\">\n      <input type=\"color\" title=\"Color\" value=\"#ffffff\" selected>\n    </fieldset>\n    <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Overlay\" name=\"overlay\" condition=\"bg.type !== 'color'\" checked>\n    <input type=\"color\" title=\"Overlay Color\" name=\"overlayColor\" value=\"#fafafa\" condition=\"overlay && bg.type == 'image'\">\n    <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Opacity\" name=\"overlayOpacity\" min=\"0\" max=\"1\" step=\"0.1\" value=\"0.1\" condition=\"overlay && bg.type == 'image'\">\n  </mbr-parameters>\n  <div class=\"mbr-overlay\" mbr-if=\"overlay && bg.type !== 'color'\"></div>\n  <div mbr-class=\"{'container': !fullWidth, 'container-fluid': fullWidth}\">\n    <div class=\"row justify-content-center\">\n      <div class=\"col-12 content-head\">\n        <div class=\"mbr-section-head mb-4\" mbr-if=\"showTitle || showSubtitle || showmainButton\">\n          <h4 class=\"mbr-section-title mbr-fonts-style align-center mb-0\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-2\" mbr-if=\"showTitle\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-section-title\">\n            <b>Title</b>\n          </h4>\n          <div class=\"subtitle-wrap w-100\">\n            <h5 class=\"mbr-section-subtitle mbr-fonts-style align-center mb-0 mt-3\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" mbr-if=\"showSubtitle\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-section-subtitle, .subtitle-wrap, .mbr-section-btn\">Subtitle\n            </h5>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"row\">\n      <div class=\"card col-12 col-md-12 col-lg-3\">\n        <div class=\"item-wrapper\">\n          <div class=\"item-img\">\n            <div class=\"image-wrapper\">\n\n            </div>\n\n            <div class=\"link-icon-wrapper\">\n              <svg class=\"svg1\" viewBox=\"0 0 100 100\">\n                <path d=\"m100,0H0v100C0,44.77,44.77,0,100,0Z\"></path>\n              </svg>\n\n              <div class=\"icon-wrap\">\n                <a href=\"index.html\"><span mbr-icon class=\"mbr-iconfont mbr-iconfont-btn mobi-mbri-left mobi-mbri\"></span></a>\n              </div>\n\n              <svg class=\"svg2\" viewBox=\"0 0 100 100\">\n                <path d=\"m100,0H0v100C0,44.77,44.77,0,100,0Z\"></path>\n              </svg>\n\n            </div>\n\n            <div class=\"item-content\" mbr-if=\"showCardTitle || showCardSubtitle || showText || showButtons\">\n              <h5 class=\"item-title mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-5\" data-app-selector=\".item-title\" mbr-if=\"showCardTitle\"><b>Privacy Policy</b></h5>\n\n            </div>\n            <h4 class=\"item-link mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" data-app-selector=\".item-link\" mbr-if=\"showLink\">\n              <a href=\"#\" class=\"text-black\">Read more</a>\n            </h4>\n\n          </div>\n\n\n        </div>\n      </div>\n\n\n      <div class=\"card-text col-lg-8\">\n        <h2 class=\"mbr-title2 mbr-fonts-style mb-3\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-title2\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\"><b>Privacy Policy for <i>pitchAccelerate</i> (operated by Rowdy Independents LLC)</b></h2>\n        <p class=\"mbr-text mb-0 mbr-fonts-style\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-text\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\">Effective Date: January 1, 2025\n<br>\n<br>Know that we respect and value your privacy. This Privacy Policy explains how <i>pitchAccelerate</i> collects, uses, discloses, and safeguards your information when you visit this website, use any provided services, or engage with <i>pitchAccelerate</i> in other ways. Please read this policy carefully to understand company views and practices regarding your personal data and how <i>pitchAccelerate</i> will treat it.\n<br>\n<br><b>1. Information We Collect\n</b><br>\n<br><i>pitchAccelerate</i> collects several types of information, including:\n<br>\n<br>Personal Identification Information: Name, email address, phone number, and other similar contact data.\n<br>\n<br>Technical Information: IP address, browser type, operating system, and browsing habits through cookies and similar technologies.\n<br>\n<br>Usage Data: Information about how you interact with our website, such as pages visited, time spent, and features used.\n<br>\n<br>Transaction Information: If you make purchases or enter into financial transactions with <i>pitchAccelerate</i>, your payment details and related transaction information is collected.\n<br>\n<br><b>2. How We Use Your Information\n</b><br>\n<br><i>pitchAccelerate</i> may use any collected information for the following purposes:\n<br>\n<br>To provide and maintain <i>pitchAccelerate</i> services.\n<br>\n<br>To improve user experience and website functionality.\n<br>\n<br>To process transactions and fulfill orders.\n<br>\n<br>To communicate with you regarding updates, promotions, or other information relevant to your engagement with <i>pitchAccelerate</i>.\n<br>\n<br>To comply with legal obligations.\n<br>\n<br><b>3. Information Sharing and Disclosure\n</b><br>\n<br>No mobile information will be shared with third parties/affiliates for marketing/promotional purposes. Information sharing to subcontractors in support services, such as customer service is permitted. All other use case categories exclude text messaging originator opt-in data and consent; this information will not be shared with any third parties.\n<br>\n<br>Legal Obligations: <i>pitchAccelerate</i> may disclose your information when required by law in response to subpoenas, court orders, or legal processes.\n<br>\n<br><b>4. Data Security\n</b><br>\n<br><i>pitchAccelerate</i>&nbsp;is committed to protecting your personal information. This company uses industry-standard security measures to safeguard your data from unauthorized access, alteration, or destruction. However, no data transmission over the internet can be guaranteed as 100% secure, and <i>pitchAccelerate</i> cannot ensure or warrant the security of any information transmitted during business transactions.\n<br>\n<br><b>5. Cookies and Tracking Technologies\n</b><br>\n<br><i>pitchAccelerate</i> uses cookies and similar tracking technologies to enhance your experience on this website. Cookies help <i>pitchAccelerate</i>&nbsp;to remember your preferences, improve site performance, and analyze user behavior. You may choose to disable cookies in your browser settings, but doing so may affect certain functionalities of this site.\n<br>\n<br><b>6. Your Rights\n</b><br>\n<br>Depending on your location, you may have certain rights regarding your personal data, including:\n<br>\n<br>The right to access, correct, or delete your personal information.\n<br>\n<br>The right to object to or restrict the processing of your data.\n<br>\n<br>The right to withdraw consent for data processing where consent is the legal basis.\n<br>\n<br><b>7. Changes to This Privacy Policy\n</b><br>\n<br><i>pitchAccelerate</i> may update this Privacy Policy from time to time. Any changes will be posted on this page with an updated effective date. You are encouraged to review this policy periodically to stay informed about how <i>pitchAccelerate</i>&nbsp;is protecting your information.\n<br>\n<br><b>Questions, Comments, or Concerns\n</b><br>If you have any questions, comments, or concerns about the contents of this page, or simply wish to reach out to&nbsp;<i>pitchAccelerate</i> for any other reason, you may do so by sending an email to the following address: xxx<br>\n        </p>\n      </div>\n\n\n\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</section>",
